    "https://academicjobsonline.org/ajo/jobs/32159": {
      "title": "AcademicJobsOnline.org",
      "description": "Boğaziçi University, Intitute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence Skip to main content AcademicJobsOnline .org ‌ View Jobs Events Registered Employers Contact Us Login Boğaziçi University, Intitute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence Position ID: Boğaziçi University-Intitute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence-BOGAZICIUDSAIBUDSAIPOS [#32159] Position Title: Assistant/Associate Professor Position Type: Tenured/Tenure-track faculty Position Location: BeşiktaşIstanbul 34342, Turkiye [ map ] Subject Areas: Computational Social Science Cognitive Science Computer Science / Learning at Scale Artificial Intelligence / Intelligent Systems and Applications Computational Neurosciences (more...) Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning and Autonomy Bioinformatics Information Science Vision Science Quantitative Analysis Machine Learning Mathematical Science Computational Science and Engineering / Natural Language Processing Quantum Machine Learning Human Computer Interaction Appl Deadline: 2026/09/15 08:59 PM PDT (posted 2026/06/04 09:00 PM PDT , listed until 2027/03/05 08:59 PM PST ) Position Description: Apply Position Description Faculty Positions in\nArtificial Intelligence Position ID: BogaziciU-DSAI-BUDSAIPOS [#00001] Position Title: Assistant/Associate Professor Position Type: Tenured/Tenure-track faculty Position Location: Bebek, Istanbul, Türkiye Subject Area: Artificial Intelligence Application Deadline: September 15, 2026, 11:59 PM Position Description Boğaziçi University Institute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence (DSAI) invites applications for multiple tenured or tenure-track faculty positions, with a preference for hiring at the Assistant and Associate Professor levels. We welcome outstanding candidates working in all fields of artificial intelligence. Areas of particular interest include; -\tTheoretical AI, -\tGenerative AI, -\tNatural Language Processing, -\tAgentic AI, -\tComputer Vision, -\tAutonomous Vehicles, -\tRobotics, -\tIntelligent Control, -\tReinforcement Learning, -\tPhysics-informed Neural Networks, -\tAI for Health and Biomedical Applications, -\tAI for Social Sciences, -\tAI for Finance, -\tAI for Computing Systems and Computing for AI, -\tBiological Intelligence, -\tLarge-scale Computational Frameworks, -\tSecure and Trustworthy AI, -\tSensing and Imaging, -\tNeuroscience-inspired AI, -\tExplainable AI. Applicants with strong theoretical AI expertise are especially welcome. Candidates are expected to hold PhD degrees from top-ranked universities, have a strong publication record in first-class international journals and/or leading AI conferences, and demonstrate full dedication to high-impact research, excellence in teaching, graduate supervision, and service to the academic community. Information on DSAI's cutting-edge, multidisciplinary research and teaching activities can be found at https://dsai.bogazici.edu.tr/ . By leveraging data-driven and AI-based approaches, Boğaziçi DSAI provides a dynamic research environment that supports creative and applicable solutions to pressing challenges in health, security, automation, science, industry, and society. DSAI brings together multidisciplinary faculty members and students from diverse academic backgrounds and has become one of the most attractive academic units at Boğaziçi University, receiving the highest number of applicants in the university. As a government-backed institution, Boğaziçi DSAI maintains valuable collaborations with public institutions, industry, and private organizations. Its entrepreneurial and innovation-oriented culture supports business intelligence solutions, technology transfer, and research-driven initiatives that translate cutting-edge academic work into impactful real-world applications. Commitment to Inclusive Excellence The Institute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence at Boğaziçi University is strongly committed to advancing inclusive excellence across research, teaching, mentoring, and service. A diverse faculty, broadly representing a wide range of identities, lived experiences, disciplines, and perspectives, is essential for academic excellence and innovation. We seek faculty members who value collaboration, respect, openness, and the participation and success of students and researchers from all backgrounds. Application Materials Interested candidates should submit the following by September 15, 2026: •\tCover letter, including contact information; •\tCurriculum vitae; • Research statement, no more than 3 pages, describing past research accomplishments, future research plans, and experiences demonstrating commitment to a diverse and inclusive research environment; • Teaching and mentoring statement, no more than 3 pages, describing teaching philosophy, previous teaching and mentoring experiences, future teaching plans, and experiences promoting an inclusive learning environment; •\tList of two to four references who can provide letters on behalf of the candidate; letters will be requested after the first round of application evaluations; •\tRepresentative publications. Publications in leading journals and AI conferences such as NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, CVPR, ACL, AAAI, EMNLP, NAACL, EACL, IJCAI, KDD, and related venues are considered a strong plus. Applicants should have an earned doctorate in Electrical and Computer Engineering, Computer Science, Applied Mathematics, Physics, Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, or a closely related field. Review of applications will begin immediately. Applications received by September 15, 2026 will receive priority attention, and later applications may be considered until the positions are filled.\nPlease send your application documents by email to the search committee chair at positions.dsai@bogazici.edu.tr . About Boğaziçi University Boğaziçi University is a leading research institution in Türkiye, dedicated to high-quality research, education, publications, and international academic impact. The university is committed to Affirmative Action and Equal Opportunity Employment, ensuring equal opportunities regardless of age, color, disability, gender, gender expression, gender identity, genetic information, national origin, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation, or veteran status. About the Institute Boğaziçi DSAI fosters a community rooted in collaboration, innovation, creativity, multidisciplinarity, and inclusion. Its success relies on a vibrant exchange of ideas enriched by the diverse perspectives, backgrounds, and expertise of its members. Respect for every member's contributions and a shared responsibility to uphold these principles are essential to the Institute's mission and values. We are not accepting applications for this job through AcademicJobsOnline.Org right now. Please email dsai.admissions@bogazici.edu.tr. Contact: Prof. Şuayb Arslan Email: Postal Mail: Boğaziçi University, South Campus, Institute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence, Bebek/Istanbul-Turkiye Web Page: https://dsai.bogazici.edu.tr © 2026 AcademicJobsOnline.Org. All Rights Reserved."
