ve a strong publication record in first-class international journals and/or leading data science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, statistics, information systems, and computing venues, and demonstrate full dedication to high-impact research, excellence in teaching, graduate supervision, and service to the academic community. Information on DSAI's cutting-edge, multidisciplinary research and teaching activities can be found at https://dsai.bogazici.edu.tr . By leveraging data-driven, statistical, computational, and AI-based approaches, Boğaziçi DSAI provides a dynamic research environment that supports creative and applicable solutions to pressing challenges in health, finance, environment, security, automation, science, industry, and society. The Institute brings together multidisciplinary faculty members and students from diverse academic backgrounds and has become one of the most attractive academic units at Boğaziçi University, receiving the highest number of applicants in the university. As a government-backed institution, Boğaziçi DSAI maintains valuable collaborations with public institutions, industry, and private organizations. Its entrepreneurial and innovation-oriented culture supports business intelligence solutions, data-driven decision-making, technology transfer, and research-driven initiatives that translate cutting-edge academic work into impactful real-world applications. Commitment to Inclusive Excellence The Institute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence at Boğaziçi University is strongly committed to advancing inclusive excellence across research, teaching, mentoring, and service. A diverse faculty, broadly representing a wide range of identities, lived experiences, disciplines, and perspectives, is essential for academic excellence and innovation. We seek faculty members who value collaboration, respect, openness, and the participation and success of students and researchers from all backgrounds. Application Materials Interested candidates should submit the following by September 15, 2026: •\tCover letter, including contact information; •\tCurriculum vitae; •\tResearch statement, no more than 3 pages, describing past research accomplishments, future research plans, and experiences demonstrating commitment to a diverse and inclusive research environment; •\tTeaching and mentoring statement, no more than 3 pages, describing teaching philosophy, previous teaching and mentoring experiences, future teaching plans, and experiences promoting an inclusive learning environment; •\tList of two to four references who can provide letters on behalf of the candidate; letters will be requested after the first round of application evaluations; •\tRepresentative publications. Publications in leading journals and conferences in data science, machine learning, statistics, artificial intelligence, information systems, databases, and computing, such as KDD, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, AAAI, ACL, EMNLP, NAACL, EACL, IJCAI, SIGMOD, VLDB, ICDE, TheWebConf, CVPR, and related venues, are considered a strong plus. Applicants should have an earned doctorate in Data Science, Statistics, Computer Science, Electrical and Computer Engineering, Industrial Engineering, Applied Mathematics, Physics, Artificial Intelligence, Information Systems, or a closely related field. Review of applications will begin immediately. Applications received by September 15, 2026 will receive priority attention, and later applications may be considered until the positions are filled.\nPlease send your application documents by email to the search committee chair at positions.dsai@bogazici.edu.tr . About Boğaziçi University Boğaziçi University is a leading research institution in Türkiye, dedicated to high-quality research, education, publications, and international academic impact. The university is committed to Affirmative Action and Equal Opportunity Employment, ensuring equal opportunities regardless of age, color, disability, gender, gender expression, gender identity, genetic information, national origin, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation, or veteran status. About the Institute Boğaziçi DSAI fosters a community rooted in collaboration, innovation, creativity, multidisciplinarity, and inclusion. Its success relies on a vibrant exchange of ideas enriched by the diverse perspectives, backgrounds, and expertise of its members. Respect for every member's contributions and a shared responsibility to uphold these principles are essential to the Institute's mission and values. We are not accepting applications for this job through AcademicJobsOnline.Org right now. Please see the job description above on how to apply. Contact: Prof. Şuayb Arslan Email: Postal Mail: Boğaziçi University, South Campus, Institute for Data Science and Artificial Intelligence, Bebek/Istanbul-Turkiye Web Page: https://dsai.bogazici.edu.tr © 2026 AcademicJobsOnline.Org. All Rights Reserved."
